ed_at":"2026-10-26T12:00:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114044668","verified_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4868180-1846651706694071","game_id":"steam-4868180","kind":"announcement","title":"Full Demo Playthrough by the Developer","summary":"Watch the developer play through the entire demo from start to finish.This video presents the complete demo experience, including combat, story progression, unit controls, and major gameplay systems.This is a pre-recorded broadcast and will repeat throughout the scheduled broadcast period.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T07:29:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694071","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4868180-1846651706691404","game_id":"steam-4868180","kind":"announcement","title":"Tale of Specters is in Steam Next Fest — play the demo now","summary":"Tale of Specters: Joseon 1592 is participating in Steam Next Fest this week (October 19–26). Play the demo right now!Tale of Specters: Joseon 1592 is available at Steam Next Fest.The demo covers the campaign from the beginning to Stage 8, lasting approximately 30–40 minutes.Playable Content:It features grid-based combat utilizing elevation differences and terrain, allowing for tactical movement through map rotation.Tactics are possible using Earth, Water, Fire, and Wind elemental strengths and w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691404","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4868180-1846651706686137","game_id":"steam-4868180","kind":"announcement","title":"Hello. This is Leon, the solo developer of “Tale of Specters: Joseon 1592.”","summary":"Here’s what’s new in this demo update:Reworked the elevation and rock layout of the demo battle maps. Taking the high ground matters more now.Bows, guns and spells aimed downward from high ground no longer have a height limit. In exchange, accuracy drops a little when the height gap is large.Enemy archers and gunners now take the highest positions first.Improved story delivery. Revised the on-map dialogue.Fixed some English dialogue.Thank you for playing my game.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T04:59:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686137","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4868180-1846651706673332","game_id":"steam-4868180","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update — Chinese & Spanish Added, Terrain Tactics Expanded","summary":"Hello, this is Leon, the solo developer of \"Tale of Specters: Joseon 1592\".The demo has been updated.■ New languages- Added Simplified Chinese and Latin American Spanish. You can switch in Options.■ Terrain tactics- Ranged attacks (bows, muskets) are blocked when a rock or wall base stands right in front of the target. Covered tiles are shown in black while aiming.- Pushing an enemy down to lower ground deals fall damage; slamming into rocks, walls, or other units deals collision damage.- Push d","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T06:43:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673332","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4868180-1846018067929240","game_id":"steam-4868180","kind":"announcement","title":"Title: Reworked Stage Openings, Stronger Combos & Smarter Enemies","summary":"Hello, I'm Leon, the solo developer of Tale of Specters: Joseon 1592.Here's what's new in the October 8 demo update.■ Stages- Stage openings have been rebuilt and shortened. The situation is set up in the battle scene with illustrations, and the characters' lines play out in speech bubbles on the map, leading into each stage's objective.- Raid on Kuroda's Supply Train: the supply wagon now appears on the battlefield. Reach the tile next to it first to secure it.- Bandits of Mount Odae: the battl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T11:01:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929240","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4868180-1845383656381183","game_id":"steam-4868180","kind":"announcement","title":"New Prologue \"The Burning Village\" (Oct 2)","summary":"Hello, I'm Leon, the developer of Tale of Specters: Joseon 1592.Here's what's new in the October 2 demo update. ■ New Prologue: \"The Burning Village\"- Right after the opening movie, your first battle begins in a village set ablaze by raiders.- Fight alongside Hong Sa-heon, Lee Dong-gil and Maechang and learn the basics of combat as you go.- Difficulty is now chosen after the prologue.■ Battle- New rule, Rout: once the remaining enemies number half your surviving units or fewer, choose \"Pursue th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T13:00:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656381183","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4868180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T